We believe you are more than your resume, your CV. We showcase creative work, experiences, and more, including travel, interests, and likes.<p>Rize lets users create rich profiles with projects, writings, a gallery, and privacy-aware analytics. It includes a dashboard, onboarding flow, and OAuth sign-in.<p>LinkedIn was built for your parents.
It wants you to look &quot;polished,&quot; &quot;professional,&quot; and already &quot;established.&quot;
But what if you&#x27;re just starting out?<p>You don&#x27;t have years of experience. You don&#x27;t have a fancy resume. What you do have are… sketches, side projects, edits, reflections, experiments.<p>It&#x27;s time for you to have your own story told on the platform that is built for you.
